{"id":"n62283-1-8","stage":5,"title":"설계 · 规划","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62283-1-8-1","ko":"설날에 뭐했니?","zh":"春节的时候你做了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"설날에","meaning":"春节","explanation":"설날：春节；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"설날","audio":"/audio/bcf982ecaec0843c761c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69055","senseId":"1","lemma":"설날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설날에","audio":"/audio/ac22f20166becb404552.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐했니?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐했니","audio":"/audio/3dcfef762449b17235cc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf982ecaec0843c","term":"설날","zh":"春节","audio":"/audio/bcf982ecaec0843c761c.mp3","entryId":"69055","definition":"韩国节日之一。日期为阴历1月1日，这天早晨家人、亲戚聚在一起举行祭祀，给长辈拜年。还吃年糕汤、玩掷柶游戏、跳跳板、放风筝等民俗游戏。","pronunciation":["설ː랄"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/402286504f8c8ad9f3e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62283-1-8-2","ko":"가족들이랑 새해 설계를 하면서 올해 할 일을 생각해 봤어.","zh":"我和家人一起制定了新年的计划，同时思考了今年要做的事情。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족들이랑","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들이랑","audio":"/audio/f90a1cd7ae43f51544d9.mp3"}},{"text":"새해","meaning":"新年","explanation":"새해：新年","readings":[{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67897","senseId":"1","lemma":"새해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}},{"text":"설계를","meaning":"规划","explanation":"설계：规划；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설계","audio":"/audio/4a827e33535875aa07d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62283","senseId":"1","lemma":"설계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설계를","audio":"/audio/5276641d46340eabe53b.mp3"}},{"text":"하면서","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면서","audio":"/audio/322ffdccdf0c979bc02e.mp3"}},{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"생각해","meaning":"想，考虑","explanation":"생각하다：想，考虑；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각해","audio":"/audio/ef94867b7401a550a940.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"9131dc433c64dfce","term":"새해","zh":"新年","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3","entryId":"67897","definition":"新开始的一年。","pronunciation":["새해"]},{"id":"4a827e33535875aa","term":"설계","zh":"规划","audio":"/audio/4a827e33535875aa07d1.mp3","entryId":"62283","definition":"对将来的事情制定计划；或指该计划。","pronunciation":["설계","설게"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"6ffd015ff4c3322a","term":"생각하다","zh":"想，考虑","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3","entryId":"66376","definition":"很想做某事或对某事感兴趣。","pronunciation":["생가카다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보